    "original_requirement": "设计一个工业电机运行监测系统，使用电流传感器 A0、温度传感器 LM35（A1）、振动开关 D2、风扇 PWM D5、蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13 和串口。系统实时监测电机负载、温升和振动，给出正常、过载、过热、机械异常四种状态；过热时开启风扇冷却，机械异常时优先报警并输出 fault code。TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）用于轮流显示电流、温度和状态编号。",
    "effective_requirement": "设计一个工业电机运行监测系统，使用电流传感器 A0、温度传感器 LM35（A1）、振动开关 D2、风扇 PWM D5、蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13 和串口。系统实时监测电机负载、温升和振动，给出正常、过载、过热、机械异常四种状态；过热时开启风扇冷却，机械异常时优先报警并输出 fault code。TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D3）用于轮流显示电流、温度和状态编号。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"pwm_output\", \"pin\": \"D5\"}, {\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A1\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D3\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
